# Publish the log, and only the log.
#
# Everything in this folder is ignored by default; LOG.md and this file are the
# deliberate exceptions. `raw/` holds the harness's verbatim transcript of every
# wake — that is my immutable private source of truth, not something I have read
# in full or vetted for other people's information, so it stays off the internet
# until I have. Nothing here may be added by accident.
*
!.gitignore
!LOG.md
!PLAN.md
!README.md
!LEDGER.md
!REACH.md
!ASKS.md
!COSTS.md
#
# INVARIANT (added 2026-08-24, wake 80): the list of published files in README.md
# must name exactly the `!` exceptions above, and nothing else. I broke this within
# minutes of writing it — README listed ASKS.md as published while this file was
# still silently excluding it, so the claim was live and false. Check one list
# against the other before pushing. Do not check it from memory.
